          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dira worrale balleese. Worri Israeli, ato oobru worraa taani keesa dabru, d'akha iti guure oobru ch'ufa d'akhaani duuche; ammalle madda ch'ufa duuchani, mukeeni worraa dadansa ch'ufa ch'irani. Eege, dira Kea-Haresethi ch'allaati hafe, isaale worri gullubaa marse d'akhaani had'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
