          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani ilma isaa ka angafa ka isa gula sila hayyu tahu, fuud'e dallaa d'akhaa ka dira sunini jaarani gubbati qale, waaqa Moabuti sorio baase. Worri Israeli aka taka inargini sodaate, dudda duubati deebie, kae lafa ufiti ufira gale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
